ックンバナナ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:142467","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c66487","characterName":"俺","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"57281","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"221460"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17473"],"vndbCharacterId":"c66487"},"originalCharacterName":"俺","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"36"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A sleep-deprived hitman grapples with chronic insomnia."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Operating under the pseudonym \"Muraki Takeo\" in Japan and the Hong Kong alias \"Zeng Heixing,\" he has established a residence in a love hotel on the fringes of Kabukicho. His days are typically spent working at the hotel with little enthusiasm, only accepting assassination contracts when they arise."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His life takes an unexpected turn after an encounter with Azami. Their sexual interaction leads to the most restful sleep he's ever experienced, leaving him reluctant to part ways with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on Shiravune, via MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c66487"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"不眠症に苦しむ殺し屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に寝不足でテンションが低い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本人だが香港出身の中国人として通っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本名「村木武生（むらき・たけお）」、中国名「曾黒星（ゾン・ヘイシン）」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歌舞伎町の外れにあるラブホテルの一室に定住している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日頃はそこの雇われ従業員として無気力に過ごし、仕事が入った時だけ殺し屋として活動する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あざみに出会い、彼女を抱くことで眠れるようになってから、あざみを手放せなくなる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17473","sourceWorkId":"25299","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"不眠症に苦しむ殺し屋。常に寝不足でテンションが低い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本人だが香港出身の中国人として通っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本名「村木武生（むらき・たけお）」、中国名「曾黒星（ゾン・ヘイシン）」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歌舞伎町の外れにあるラブホテルの一室に定住している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日頃はそこの雇われ従業員として無気力に過ごし、仕事が入った時だけ殺し屋として活動する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あざみに出会い、彼女を抱くことで眠れるようになってから、あざみを手放せなくなる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"57281"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2f82f54a6effdbcd6a96fa89aef4572b8d2d2a931473d2d8a444005282248bc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/648299440a4f5244c3180775502341ad8cb9a6ab7b7056d3ee5c48f150de807c.webp","width":86,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杉崎亮","creatorId":"vndb:s7065","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7065","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7065","name":"杉崎 亮","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:221460:57281:4877:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c66488","characterName":"あざみ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"57282","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"221460"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17474"],"vndbCharacterId":"c66488"},"originalCharacterName":"あざみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious call girl who happens to visit the hotel the protagonist lives in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cheerful and carefree young woman with an ever-present shadow, she ends up being hunted by the yakuza after a client dies on her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Shiravune, via MangaGamer"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Azami's extraordinary transformation began with a tragic childhood incident. During an assassination mission gone awry, a younger Takeo accidentally shot Azami in the head. The critical surgery to remove the bullet saved her life but had unforeseen consequences. It shattered her brain's natural limitations, unlocking superhuman strength while eroding her moral compass and igniting an insatiable thirst for violence."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"To channel her lethal urges and protect innocents, her brother turned her into a vigilante, targeting criminals beyond the reach of the law. Yet, despite these efforts, her sanity continues to unravel. She's teetering on the brink of becoming a mindless predator, indiscriminately hunting any living being that crosses her path."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c66488"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の住むホテルを偶然利用したデリヘル嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"派遣先の客の死で、東儀に追われる身となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素性は不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく朗らかな飄々とした雰囲気の中にとりとめのない影を持つ、謎の少女。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17474","sourceWorkId":"25299","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の住むホテルを偶然利用したデリヘル嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"派遣先の客の死で、東儀に追われる身となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素性は不明。明るく朗らかな飄々とした雰囲気の中にとりとめのない影を持つ、謎の少女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"57282"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c6327eeca9fbe3439bf0c502dea1812cc2cbd15291f2e01d16814fbae213c7c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/6319707db05f35a772cc07e8fc48888a3fbd106a10c6b90459b21cf5cb9f5e61.webp","width":104,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前田恵","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:221460:57282:8580:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c66706","characterName":"仁礼 春彦","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"chara